refused 10
  row_access_control           orders.regional_only           a row-level access control has no sutura equivalent
  calculated_column            orders.amount_dollars          a calculated column carries a SQL expression sutura's column metadata cannot hold
  column_access_control        orders.notes                   a column-level access control has no sutura equivalent
  ref_sql_model                recent_orders                  a model with `refSql` set is a SQL view; conversion never parses foreign SQL
  unrecognised_join_condition  orders_customer_legacy         the condition is not a plain equality between two declared columns
  many_to_many_relationship    customer_products_history      MANY_TO_MANY has no JoinType in sutura's closed vocabulary
  sql_view                     recent_orders_view             a wren view is a named SQL statement; conversion never parses foreign SQL
  cube_hierarchy               sales_summary: calendar        a cube hierarchy has no sutura equivalent
  free_sql_dimension           sales_summary.region_shout     the expression is not a bare column name
  free_sql_measure             sales_summary.inflated_revenue the expression is not one of the closed-vocabulary shapes

notes
  orders.customer is a relationship-navigation column; represented by the `orders_customer` relationship document instead of a model column
  every mapped model was written with `source: wren`; rename it to match this deployment's own `sources:` declaration before committing
